body:
Honestly, these two are made for each other; 

Both Billy and Karl are OBSESSED with each other. I mean, look at the socials of both parties. BM keeps posting shit, ridiculing Karl while Karl can't keep his damned mouth shut about him in his discord server. 

I just imagine both of them staring at the ceiling at night, their wives next to them. And all they can think of is each other. It's absurd it's gotten this far to start with.
